    <content>
      <![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd">
<en-note><div>Post-deadline decompress beats. UIST is in, brain is mush, this is the only thing that sounds fun.</div><div><br/></div><ul><li>160 bpm half-time feel, sparse. kick only on 1 and the "and" of 3. big room reverb on the snare, gated.</li><li>E minor, pluck lead with Sytrus preset, distortion 20%.</li><li>arrangement: 8 bar intro (filtered), 16 hook, 16 verse, 8 break (drums out, only pad + vocal chop), 16 hook.</li><li>the bounce is too long (3:40). cut verse 2.</li><li>808: tune to E, decay 600 ms, a little saturation so it shows up on laptop speakers.</li></ul><div><br/></div><div>Exported "aprilwip_03.wav". send to Owen? he has good ears for drums.</div></en-note>]]>
    </content>
  </note>
</en-export>
